# 🚀 PERFORMANCE TRICKS (INTERVIEW GOLD)

| Technique       | Why                       |
| --------------- | ------------------------- |
| Debounce        | reduce API calls          |
| AbortController | cancel stale requests     |
| Cache           | instant repeated queries  |
| useMemo         | cheap highlight rendering |
| Limit results   | avoid DOM bloat           |

